<title>USA: City National sees charge, Q4 EPS $0.37. [CORRECTED 14:39 GMT]</title>
<headline>City National sees charge, Q4 EPS $0.37. [CORRECTED 14:39 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BEVERLY HILLS, Calif. 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>City National Corp said Wednesday it estimates fourth quarter net earnings will be $16.9 million, or $0.37 per share.</p>
<p>It expects full-year earnings of $66.6 million, or $1.47 per share, including an after-tax charge of $1.97 million ($3.4 million (corrects from $3.7 million) pre-tax), or $0.04 per share, for settling a lender liability lawsuit, City National said.</p>
</text>
